Z||000005||DJRice||11-14-2001||10:33 PM||||Actually, I didn't know the fender was broken until I got the nose off.  I bought the car two years ago and have wanted to replace the nose on it for quite some time because it was sagging in the middle and looked funky.  When I got the nose loose, the "waffle" support just fell off and I noticed that the fender was broken as well.  <P>I replaced a cracked turn signal cover, remounted the waffle support, and replaced the nose.  She looks much better now, but the nose could use a professional paint job.<P>------------------<BR>Dillon<BR>Black '87 SE V6<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/djr_signature.jpg"> <BR>"And this one time, on the Fiero Forum..."||||reg||1
